 A person with whom one has had sexual relations. (NCI)
 The individual with whom one is having sex. (CSP)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0036911</skos:definition>
        <UMLS_CUI rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C0036911</UMLS_CUI>
