        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The state of the ATMOSPHERE over minutes to months. (MSH)
 The state of the atmosphere at a given time and place, with respect to variables such as temperature, moisture, wind velocity, and barometric pressure. (NCI)
 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0043085</skos:definition>
